            <h3 class="mb-5">Event Planning & Management</h3>
            <p class="frame-service-text">
                Our lives are defined by milestones. At times random. But for the ones which are planned, we have got some good insights about them. In other words, assisting you to develop a solid business case and then an event that delivers better than promised. And these got real world goals at the core - generate sales leads, build client loyalty, boost employee morale, celebrate an achievement – in a roundtable conference or in an audience of many scores, MICE Hospitality will ensure that it's worthy of your trust in us.
            </p>
